{"id":"n62478-1-13","stage":1,"title":"잘못 · 错","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62478-1-13-1","ko":"누구시죠? 저를 아시나요?","zh":"您是哪位？您认识我吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누구시죠?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구시죠","audio":"/audio/e66ce82a28a7124405aa.mp3"}},{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저를","audio":"/audio/da4de346f30de5013b78.mp3"}},{"text":"아시나요?","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아시나요","audio":"/audio/1e706700fb9c838e9a87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01bf29bb2285649f88be.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62478-1-13-2","ko":"앗, 죄송합니다. 아는 사람인 줄 알고, 제가 잘못 봤나 봅니다.","zh":"啊，对不起。我以为您是认识的人，看来是我看错了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앗,","meaning":"唷","explanation":"앗：唷","readings":[{"term":"앗","audio":"/audio/a28f6e8256f2559b68d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66864","senseId":"1","lemma":"앗","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앗","audio":"/audio/a28f6e8256f2559b68d6.mp3"}},{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아는","audio":"/audio/4ac69e5a586c3d19cbfa.mp3"}},{"text":"사람인","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람인","audio":"/audio/278df8900306e5948306.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"알고,","meaning":"看做","explanation":"알다：看做；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"11","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알고","audio":"/audio/8cb0c0a5afacb043256e.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}},{"text":"봤나","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤나","audio":"/audio/9a450fd2a947916e49c8.mp3"}},{"text":"봅니다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봅니다","audio":"/audio/ee1730c2d4e4dba7c177.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a28f6e8256f2559b","term":"앗","zh":"唷","audio":"/audio/a28f6e8256f2559b68d6.mp3","entryId":"66864","definition":"吃惊时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["앋"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识；看做","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audi